Description: Speech Dispatcher module: a voice per language
 RHVoiceVoice "<language>" "<voice>" lines in the module configuration file
 (passed by Speech Dispatcher as the first argument) choose the voice a
 language is spoken with when the client does not ask for a voice by name.
 Without them the voice type selects the n-th male or female voice of the
 language, which leaves most voices unreachable from the settings.
